        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXGn_cYreJFM_LADm0Iv2vfBfYrU9h11nfUQwV59TqmdsP9rNUU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "We had the pleasure of meeting Ryan and Darcy and Bill! We moved some big pieces form Pincourt to the Laurentians  and we were very happy with their service!  The guys have a cheery disposition and are very friendly! Will definitely use them again if the need arises! Good luck gang and thanks again! Sandra",
        "time": 1685987764,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ashley",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106912124958187152730/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKbCDt84GmXR312rF1nLD55THeGGDdGwNQxKIVnTiaLOML_T8M=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "We had an absolutely amazing experience with Ryan and Darcy. They were punctual and super efficient in moving us. Awesome communication throughout and the estimate was spot on. Will definitely be contacting them again and recommending them!\n\nWe are overall so impressed with service we got and cannot be happier we found these guys through a quick Google search! It is not easy finding good movers.",
        "time": 1690986688,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Rémi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106743928417026672246/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV0XIOKw1KeN1P8rbanYL5euv9ZSWu8zJLwBuPand5TwDSdW1c=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "I was afraid to move with two young kids and no help. This went smoothly even if that was during the crazy heatwave. We have just painted the house before moving and they were very careful. Actually the only scratch on a wall was done by me trying to move a box... Bill knows his job and do it with caution and passion, the proper way. We moved three times in the last five years in Montreal and this was by far the best experience we had. And our oldest kid still ask for news from the movers!",
        "time": 1591629915,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Chris Tiki",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107409022793481150632/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIwTFGxXB43QJBrR7culU7n5bZpO8qR_8mA4H4yKD667c-5Vg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "They should be experienced enough at the price they charge to ensure a pleasant move but I ended up fielding complaints about my furniture and staircases in both houses.\n\n3 stars as the items were not damaged, but I’ve had much easier moving experiences in the past for less $.  Estimate was pretty accurate and would have been fine if they complained less- that was annoying.",
        "time": 1579048922,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jo-Ann Halstead",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112734068167816004824/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWnruDjXRTeorhV3oC-SKWk1qKlAUllhjUM04EwL9eT4RQHswXqTQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "These movers were nothing short of fantastic. They came highly recommended from a friend (they had moved her and many of her group of friends) and they helped get through a difficult move by doing all the work. They were puntual, professional and extremely good at manovuering all types of awkward items...all this and it was an extremely hot July 1 this year. Would call them for the next move and would definitely pass in their details if anyone I knew needed movers!",
        "time": 1626319819,
        "translated": false
      }
